Alterations to existing multiple dwellings classified as HCA, HACA, HCB, and HACB shall comply with this code and Sections D602.1 through D602.4.

D602.1 Increase in units/additions.

Such a dwelling shall not be increased: (i) in number of units, (ii) in height, (iii) by rooftop addition (other than a stair or elevator bulkhead), (iv) in stories, or (v) by horizontal addition so as to exceed by 25 percent or more the area on any story which such building occupied at the time of its conversions;
